content.text:
the workspace orchestrator for the docs server via vitepress should be able to fully run the transforms / rebuilds.  I want to be able to take:
formats/components/src/components/billboard.css while running `vpr docs:dev` and if I for example edit & save

```
@media (--theme-canvas),
(--theme-canvas-high-contrast) {
  .pfx-billboard.-clickable:hover {
    border-color: var(--instui-component-link-text-color);
  }
}
```

to:

```
@media (--theme-canvas),
(--theme-canvas-high-contrast) {
  .pfx-billboard.-clickable:hover {
    border-color: red;
  }
}
```

for the HMR to go through the whole process for the styles on refresh to show a red border.

