7	 * would not switch the concrete tokens (their `@property` registrations would collide). Instead we
8	 * emit the default theme (rebrand) in full — `@property` registrations + `:root` defaults — then, for
9	 * each other theme, a `:root[data-pantoken-theme="…"]` block that re-declares only the tokens whose
